+/* nvlegacy: "one copy per client buffer" cache (see nv_array_once_enabled()).
+ * entry[i] describes binding i when the app uses client arrays: the first time a range of
+ * that pointer is brought to the GPU, the entry remembers our dedicated resource and the
+ * covered interval; if a draw touches an already covered range of the SAME pointer, the copy
+ * is skipped entirely.
