+/* nv-legacy: MESA_NV_ARB_TEX_SHADOW=1 marks a plain ARB TEX fetch as a shadow fetch when
+ * the Cg debug comments declare that sampler unit as sampler2DSHADOW. Mad Mod Mike's hard
+ * omni receiver is exactly this case: the Cg program text says sampler2DSHADOW but the
+ * executable instruction remains TEX ... 2D, so without this the fetch returns the raw depth
+ * texel and the hard shadow comes out nearly white. Units that are not depth-backed still
+ * lose the shadow through st_program.c. Off by default. */
